request.description:
Get paginated bank account requests with optional filters.

Pagination is returned inside `meta.pagination`:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Bank account requests retrieved successfully",
  "data": [...],
  "meta": {
    "pagination": {
      "currentPage": 1,
      "totalPages": 5,
      "totalRecords": 100,
      "limit": 20,
      "hasNextPage": true,
      "hasPrevPage": false
    }
  }
}
```

